      "sourceText": "**附加量设为0，只关自旋附加项；输入速度全零，也不会自动清掉自旋附加项。** 输入全零且 `spin_speed_≠0` 时，转换仍会输出非零角速度。收到 `cmd_spin` 也只改变量，没有立刻发布新 `cmd_vel`；之后进入速度处理回调才体现新值。它本身不是持续输出速度的独立旋转控制器。",
      "translatedText": "**Set the additional amount to 0, only disable the spin additional term; even if the input velocity is all zeros, the spin additional term will not be automatically cleared\\.** When the input is all zeros and `spin_speed_≠0` , the conversion will still output a nonzero angular velocity\\. Receiving `cmd_spin` only changes the variable and does not immediately publish a new `cmd_vel`; the new value is only reflected after entering the velocity processing callback\\. It itself is not an independent rotation controller that continuously outputs velocity\\.",
